IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa13-regulative`

-- coa13-tests-regulative.l4: traces of the regulative rules in coa13-regulative.l4. A #TRACE prints FULFILLED, a BREACH or a residual
-- obligation and no assertion line, and a DEONTIC value cannot be compared with EQUALS in an #ASSERT, so the expected outcome of each
-- trace is written in the comment above it (decided from the text before the trace was run), and work/traces.sh runs this file with
-- both stable builds and prints the Result block of every directive so that they can be read against the comments. The decision
-- function behind each duty is ASSERTed in the chapter tests. check.sh counts no assertion here: this file has 3 ASSERTs of the
-- plumbing only (the clock arithmetic of the deadlines), so that the file is not a table of zeros.

§ `Traces of the regulative rules of Part 17`

-- The clock arithmetic: allotment on 15 January 2026; two months later is 15 March 2026 (59 days), one month later 15 February (31 days).
#ASSERT (Day (`add months` (Date 15 1 2026) 2)) MINUS (Day (Date 15 1 2026)) EQUALS 59
#ASSERT (Day (`add months` (Date 15 1 2026) 1)) MINUS (Day (Date 15 1 2026)) EQUALS 31
#ASSERT (Day (`add months` (Date 31 1 2026) 1)) MINUS (Day (Date 31 1 2026)) EQUALS 28

-- s 554(1): registered on day 59 (15 March): in time. EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 554(1) the duty to register the allotment` (Date 15 1 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 554(1) the company registers the allotment of shares` AT 59

-- s 554(1): registered on day 60 (16 March): late. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company ("not registered within two months").
#TRACE `s 554(1) the duty to register the allotment` (Date 15 1 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 554(1) the company registers the allotment of shares` AT 60

-- s 555(2): return on day 31 (15 February): in time. EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 555(2) the duty to deliver the return of allotment` (Date 15 1 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 555(2) the company delivers the return of allotment to the registrar` AT 31

-- s 555(2): return on day 32: late. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company.
#TRACE `s 555(2) the duty to deliver the return of allotment` (Date 15 1 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 555(2) the company delivers the return of allotment to the registrar` AT 32

-- s 556(2): return on day 31: in time. EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 556(2) the duty to deliver the return of allotment of the new class` (Date 15 1 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 556(2) the company delivers the return of allotment of the new class to the registrar` AT 31

-- s 556(2): return on day 32: late. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company.
#TRACE `s 556(2) the duty to deliver the return of allotment of the new class` (Date 15 1 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 556(2) the company delivers the return of allotment of the new class to the registrar` AT 32

-- s 578(2): money repaid on day 48: in time. EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 578(2) the duty to repay the money received from applicants` (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 578(2) the company repays the money received from applicants` AT 48

-- s 578(2): money repaid on day 50: late; the directors' liability under s 578(3) follows. EXPECTED: the residual obligation of the
-- directors to repay the money with interest (PARTY Director MUST ...), the company's late repayment not counting for its own duty.
#TRACE `s 578(2) the duty to repay the money received from applicants` (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 578(2) the company repays the money received from applicants` AT 50

-- s 578(3): the directors then repay on day 55. EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 578(2) the duty to repay the money received from applicants` (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 578(2) the company repays the money received from applicants` AT 50
    PARTY Director DOES `s 578(3) the directors repay the money with interest` AT 55

-- s 597(1): the copy delivered on the day the return is filed. EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 597(1) the duty to deliver a copy of the valuer's report to the registrar` (Date 5 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 597(1) the company delivers a copy of the valuer's report to the registrar` AT 0

-- s 597(1): the copy delivered a day after the return. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company.
#TRACE `s 597(1) the duty to deliver a copy of the valuer's report to the registrar` (Date 5 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 597(1) the company delivers a copy of the valuer's report to the registrar` AT 1

-- s 602(1): resolution passed 1 March 2026; copy delivered on day 15 (16 March): in time. EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 602(1) the duty to deliver a copy of the resolution and the valuer's report` (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 602(1) the company delivers a copy of the resolution and the valuer's report to the registrar` AT 15

-- s 602(1): delivered on day 16: late. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company.
#TRACE `s 602(1) the duty to deliver a copy of the resolution and the valuer's report` (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 602(1) the company delivers a copy of the resolution and the valuer's report to the registrar` AT 16

-- s 549(1): the directors are prohibited (no authority under s 550 or s 551) and exercise the power on day 5. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Director.
#TRACE `s 549(1) the directors' duty not to exercise the power` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `s 549(1) the company's directors exercise the power to allot shares or grant rights` AT 5

-- s 549(1): the directors are authorised under s 551 (not prohibited). EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 549(1) the directors' duty not to exercise the power` (JUST FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `s 549(1) the company's directors exercise the power to allot shares or grant rights` AT 5

-- s 549(1): prohibited and the directors do nothing: the prohibition stands, with no event to end it. EXPECTED: the residual obligation (PARTY Director SHANT ...).
#TRACE `s 549(1) the directors' duty not to exercise the power` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 552(1) the company applies its shares or capital money in payment of a commission, discount or allowance` AT 5

-- s 552(1): the company pays a commission that s 553 does not permit. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company.
#TRACE `s 552(1) the company's duty not to apply its shares or capital money in payment` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 552(1) the company applies its shares or capital money in payment of a commission, discount or allowance` AT 3

-- s 561(1): the company allots without making the offers. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company.
#TRACE `s 561(1) the company's duty not to allot equity securities without the pre-emption offers` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 561(1) the company allots equity securities without making the pre-emption offers` AT 3

-- s 561(1): the offers were made and the period has expired (not prohibited). EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 561(1) the company's duty not to allot equity securities without the pre-emption offers` (JUST FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 561(1) the company allots equity securities without making the pre-emption offers` AT 3

-- s 562(4): an offer open for 14 days is withdrawn on day 5. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company.
#TRACE `s 562(4) the duty not to withdraw the pre-emption offer` 14 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 562(4) the company withdraws the pre-emption offer before the end of its period` AT 5

-- s 562(4): the same offer withdrawn on day 20, after its period. EXPECTED: FULFILLED (the prohibition ran only to the end of the period).
#TRACE `s 562(4) the duty not to withdraw the pre-emption offer` 14 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 562(4) the company withdraws the pre-emption offer before the end of its period` AT 20

-- s 580(1): shares allotted at a discount. EXPECTED: BREACH BY Company.
#TRACE `s 580(1) the company's duty not to allot shares at a discount` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 580(1) the company allots shares at a discount` AT 2

-- s 580(1): not at a discount (NOTHING: the prohibition does not speak of such an allotment). EXPECTED: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 580(1) the company's duty not to allot shares at a discount` NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 580(1) the company allots shares at a discount` AT 2
